Host transport dependency provenance

All external sources are unmodified registry archives obtained and checksum-verified
by Cargo. Exact versions, archive checksums, licences and unified features are in
docs/inputs/host-dependencies.toml and record 015. Cargo.lock pins the full closure.
Original source notices remain in the archives; no dependency source is vendored.
Distribution must retain the selected MIT permission notices, Apache-2.0 terms
where selected, and unicode-normalization's additional Unicode-3.0 terms.
Platform-only packages remain reviewed lock resolutions, not Linux evidence.
The new parking_lot_core build script runs on the build host. Existing reachable
async-trait and rustversion procedural macros retain their upstream build role.
The driver remains unmodified; persistence is disabled pending independent review.
